{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4e440c2e58e88ce0","name":"Wingman Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-4e440c2e58e88ce0","title":"Wingman Talent Tree","revision":20826,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:35:40Z","sha256":"0bdd6596256791eda71644c81843a8452d1a8ebbab59147cdab64a097247ac23","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20826","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Wingman%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4e440c2e58e88ce0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at flying in tight formations with your allies, working together with them to achieve your goals and using your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," to shield others from harm. To use Talents from this Talent Tree, you must be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Concentrate All Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to aid an ally's attack roll with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapon"},", if the attack hits, it deals +1 die of damage. Any ally can only benefit from this Talent once per attack roll, regardless of how many allies with this Talent aid on the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Escort Pilot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," is adjacent to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloted"}," by an ally, both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," gain a +10 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Thresholds"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Thresholds"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Lose Pursuit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," is adjacent to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloted"}," by an ally, both you and your ally gain a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks to avoid being pulled into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"}," as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Run Interference"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Escort Pilot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"}," feat to negate an attack against an adjacent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloted"}," by an ally. If you can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"}," more than once per round, each use to negate an attack counts toward your limit of uses per round.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wingman Retribution"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Escort Pilot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloted"}," by an ally is damaged by an attack, once per round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Attack"}," with a -5 penalty against your ally's attacker.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
